{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國加利福尼亞州機動車輛管理局（DMV）已正式禁止Waymo的無人駕駛出租車在全州範圍內使用高速公路開展運營。監管機構表示，該公司的自動駕駛系統在施工區域內多次出現危險行為，已經構成「對公共安全的緊迫威脅」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586836.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T21:00:38.637631+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T20:36:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T20:53:53.290522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T20:53:53.290522+00:00","content_hash":"c66433cec7675dcf845e6984f1bdc467ccb9380c6c420e71aa781d8b270cc465","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}